      'The writer uses hook, context, explanation, payoff and callback. Longer explanations can contain several timestamped scenes within one phase. Each narration scene needs its own relevant visual search phrase. If the explanation becomes three scenes, it needs three phrases, not one phrase representing the whole middle of the story.',
