      '## Arrange the review before starting production',
      'Vidora workflows do not all pause at the same point. Before a run, inspect its upload and visibility controls. Where private upload is available, choose it deliberately; where upload can be disabled, keep the file local until approval. Do not assume that a queue, a completed job or an automation setting creates a mandatory approval gate.',
