      '## Review the promise and the evidence separately',
      'Write down what the title and opening promise the viewer. Then watch the explanation without looking at the title. Can you identify where that promise is actually fulfilled? Remove a claim if you cannot substantiate it. Qualify uncertainty in the narration itself; a cautious sentence in the description does not repair an overconfident spoken claim.',
