      'The single highest-leverage habit we see among creators who actually hit consistent upload schedules: they don\'t plan one video at a time. They batch a month of topics in one sitting, queue them, and let the scheduler handle the rest.',
      '## How the queue works',
      'Add topics to the queue in any order - a scraped list, a brainstorm, or AI-suggested ideas. Each queued topic can be assigned a channel and, optionally, a specific publish date and time. The scheduler picks up queued topics automatically at the configured cadence, so you never have to remember to manually start the next job.',
      '## Cadence, not chaos',
