      '## The real bottleneck is consistency, not concept',
      'Most faceless channels don\'t fail because the concept was bad - they fail because the creator burns out on production after a few weeks and the upload cadence collapses. This is precisely the problem automation is built to solve: a queue of topics and a scheduler that keeps publishing even during a busy week.',
