      'For standard ad-revenue eligibility, YouTube lists 1,000 subscribers plus either 4,000 qualified public watch hours in the last 12 months or 10 million qualified public Shorts views in the last 90 days. The watch-hour target is not a lifetime total. Other access tiers, region availability and policy requirements differ; check the current Earn tab for your account.',
