      '## What actually accelerates the timeline',
      'Watch hours accumulate faster from longer-form content with strong retention than from a high volume of very short videos, purely because of the arithmetic - ten minutes of watch time from one video is easier to earn than the same total spread across dozens of short clips with lower absolute watch time each.',
      '## Subscribers vs. watch hours: which gates you first',
      'Either requirement can be the limiting factor. Track subscribers and the relevant qualifying watch-hour or Shorts-view window separately. Meeting the numerical thresholds starts an eligibility review; it does not guarantee monetization.',
