      'Every few weeks there\'s a new format, trend, or tool everyone insists you need to adopt immediately. Chasing each one has a real cost: it breaks whatever repeatable system you\'d built, and most trends are gone before a slow-moving production process can even catch up.',
      '## What a repeatable system actually buys you',
